{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24661","headline":"哭刘尚书梦得二首 一 · 白居易","name":"哭刘尚书梦得二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四海齐名白与刘，百年交分两绸缪。\n同贫同病退闲日，一死一生临老头。\n杯酒英雄君与操，文章微婉我知丘。\n贤豪虽殁精灵在，应共微之地下游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24661.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24661","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}